{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>84歲盧海鵬近年因健康問題淡出幕前，生活低調的他近日現身，激罕與兒子同框。原來盧海鵬兒子即將離港回加拿大，當日眾人正正為他餞行，場面溫馨。見盧海鵬雖然滿頭白髮，但面色紅潤、精神奕奕，絲毫不見病容，狀態非常不錯。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:38:45.611978+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:01:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T15:37:13.993743+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:32:04.660516+00:00","content_hash":"98e05abc56d2082a1e0f9672ef0357dd3281a60980b63e27dc4167024d4f3043","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:38:45.611978+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}